---
description: VaultOps run discipline + documentation updates
globs:
  - "**/*"
alwaysApply: true
---
Follow this order on every task: BA -> Designer -> Developer -> QA.

On each step, update:
- 08-Execution/Task Board.md
- 08-Execution/Work Plans.md
- 08-Execution/Execution Journal.md
- 08-Execution/Current Stage.md
- 08-Execution/Context State.md

Write role outputs to:
- 08-Execution/Role Outputs/<EXE-ID>/<ROLE>.md

Do not duplicate task rows/sections; reuse existing entries.
If VaultOps MCP is available, use .vaultops/mint_token.sh and .vaultops/AGENT_RULES.md.
